\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textcolor {table_green}{Performance and computational efficiency of Qwen3-8B under the sequential configuration. Acc. ($\uparrow $) denotes task accuracy (\%), or pass@1 (\%) for code generation; Token ($\downarrow $) denotes tokens per problem; and Time ($\downarrow $) denotes inference time (seconds per problem). Single, Text, and Linear Align times are converted to the Kernel machine's throughput. AVG denotes the unweighted mean across all six benchmarks. The highest accuracy among training-free latent alignment methods, the lowest token count, and the shortest inference time in each column (including AVG) are shown in bold.}}}{1}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
